#. <CLT 4>もう、こんなモニターなんかに怯えない。
#. モノクマなんか怖くない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not gonna let these things scare me anymore... I'm\n"
"not afraid of you, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình sẽ không để mấy thứ này làm mình sợ hãi nữa... Ta không sợ\n"
"ngươi đâu, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Bọn chúng luôn theo dõi chúng ta sao? Chẳng lẽ chúng\n"
"không bao giờ thấy chán à...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Thiệt, mình đã phải dồn hết sức lực chỉ để dám *nghĩ* về\n"
"việc chế nhạo bọn chúng...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>雑誌棚だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The shelf full of magazines...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>前と同じ物ばかりだ。
#. 本当に新しい号は入らないんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're all the same as before. I don't think we've\n"
"ever gotten a new issue of anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>オセロがあるのに、将棋はないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The copy of Othello is still here, but what about\n"
"shogi?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダーツ…
#. これって武器になりそうだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>These darts seem like they'd make for a good weapon.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>暗殺者っぽいキャラが使ってそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It seems like the kind of thing an assassin-type\n"
"character would use...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビリヤード台だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The pool table...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンとか…やったら似合いそうだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For some reason, I feel like Byakuya would be into\n"
"something like this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんの事件では、
#. ここに腐川さんが隠れてたんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where Toko hid when Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…似合うよな。
#. 本人にはとても言えないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It almost seems fitting. Not that I'd ever say\n"
"that to her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このソファーに…大神さんが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right near here is where Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>テーブル…
#. うん、どう見てもテーブルだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a table. That's all there is to it. Just a table.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このボトルって…モノクマが作ったのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did Monokuma make this bottle himself?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có phải Monokuma tự mình làm ra cái chai này không nhỉ?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…あの手で？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Like...by hand? Or paw? Or whatever?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このボトルって…モノクマが作ったのかな…？
